Package: com.kolby.swiftpeek
Name: SwiftPeek
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.5.3
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only SwiftUI + window-tree inspector. 0.5.3 marks any node the walk stopped at with how many children it did not visit, so a truncated walk cannot be mistaken for an empty one, and corrects the Focus guidance — it matches view classes, not controller names. Layer and gradient colour since 0.5.0. No hooks, no FOVO, every target defaults off. Debug tooling; not published.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
Section: Tweaks

